## Requirements

- [mise](https://mise.jdx.dev/) — installs the pinned Python {{ python_version }} and uv

## Getting started

```bash
mise trust && mise install   # install Python + uv
mise run setup               # uv sync + install pre-commit hooks
mise run check               # run all hooks and tests
```

Run the agent:

```bash
uv run {{ project_slug }}
```

## Development tasks

| Task                  | Description                          |
| --------------------- | ------------------------------------ |
| `mise run setup`      | Install dependencies and git hooks   |
| `mise run lint`       | Lint with ruff                       |
| `mise run format`     | Auto-fix and format with ruff        |
| `mise run typecheck`  | Type check with ty                   |
| `mise run test`       | Run the test suite with pytest       |
| `mise run check`      | Run all pre-commit hooks and tests   |

